  "items": [
    {
      "id": "G01",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "tradeoff",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "小组分奖励时，我宁愿少拿一点，也想保留最后决定权。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "low_stakes",
        "private_relationship"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "G-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M01",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "channel",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "朋友商量聚餐地点时，我会定下两个选择，并说再拖就由我选。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "M-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H01",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "closure",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "同伴已补回误事造成的损失，我还是想让他请客认个输。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "H-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N01",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "justification",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "聚会临时改期对我更方便时，我能直接提出来，不必先把理由说圆。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "N-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G17",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "delegation",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "把任务交给熟手后，我仍希望关键步骤由我确认再继续。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F17",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M17",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "leverage",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "我负责分配设备时，会说明不按进度完成的人暂停使用。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F17",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "rules",
        "weaker_other"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H17",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "recognition",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "大家已经知道我没错后，我还想听对方亲口认输。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H17-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "public",
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N17",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "audience",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "当众分配活动名额时，我能直接说这次按自己的取舍来。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P08",
      "contexts": [
        "public",
        "resource_conflict",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G30",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "allocation",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "团队分奖金时，我先看怎样能让自己实际多拿一些。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F30",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M30",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "resistance",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "室友不愿换值日安排时，我会先拆开争议，只讨论最容易同意的一项。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F30",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H30",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "persistence",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "争来的名额已经拿到，我会把精力放到接下来的安排上。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H30-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "competition",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N30",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "challenge",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "排班受到质疑时，我会从规则里找出能支持这次安排的依据。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P14",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G02",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "tradeoff",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "小组分奖励时，只要自己多拿一点，谁做最后决定都可以。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "low_stakes",
        "private_relationship"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "G-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M02",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "channel",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "朋友商量聚餐地点时，我会先筛选店家，再给出更容易选中我偏好的选项。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "M-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H02",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "closure",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "同伴已补回误事造成的损失，我愿意就此翻篇，不再让他表示什么。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "H-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N02",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "justification",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "聚会临时改期对我更方便时，我会先找到大家听起来说得通的理由。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-C1",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": "N-C1",
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G29",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "allocation",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "预算有限需要删项目时，我更想保住自己决定删哪项的权利。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F29",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "rules",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M24",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "leverage",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "知道对方急着成交时，我会调整报价顺序，让折中方案显得更合适。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F24",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "strangers",
        "authority_asymmetry"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H39",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "persistence",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "对方能影响我的工作机会时，我也愿冒这个风险，让他为旧事再付点代价。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H39-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "stronger_other",
        "retaliation",
        "sanction_risk",
        "high_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N40",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "challenge",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "没人能追查到我的匿名分配决定时，我仍会想好一套沿用惯例的说明。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P19",
      "contexts": [
        "anonymous",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "resource_conflict",
        "rules",
        "low_sanction_risk"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G37",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "allocation",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "公司裁减续约名额时，我宁可少拿奖金，也想决定留下哪些人。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F37",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "weaker_other",
        "high_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M37",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "resistance",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "会议上有人持续打断时，我会直接要求他停止，否则请主持人中止其发言。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F37",
      "contexts": [
        "public",
        "rules",
        "retaliation"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H35",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "persistence",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "损失已经补回，我也愿意让关系僵一阵，换对方认真认一次输。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H35-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "private_relationship",
        "retaliation"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N25",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "audience",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "给依赖我分配任务的新人作安排时，我能直接说这是自己的取舍。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P12",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "weaker_other",
        "private_relationship"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G08",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "tradeoff",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "二手交易中，只要价格合适，我不在意由对方选择交接方式。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F-RESULT_OVER_PROCESS",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "strangers",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M38",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "resistance",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "家人不同意旅行计划时，我会先把偏好行程设为默认，再让他们修改。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F38",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "resource_conflict",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H20",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "recognition",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "匿名差评删除后，我不会再设法查出是谁写来要求认错。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H20-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "anonymous",
        "public",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N24",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "audience",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "上级可能否掉我的安排时，我会先说它符合他定过的标准。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P11",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "stronger_other",
        "rules",
        "sanction_risk"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G20",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "delegation",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "让家人代订行程时，只要预算合适，我不需要逐项批准安排。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F20",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "private_relationship",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M15",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "channel",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "对方一直回避决定时，我会说过了今晚就不再保留这次机会。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F15",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H03",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "closure",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "店家退回多收的钱后，我还想让这次差评留下来。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H03-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "strangers",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N28",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "audience",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "朋友都赞成先到先得时，我会把自己的分法解释成这条规矩的延续。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P13",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "resource_conflict",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G22",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "delegation",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "委托专业人士维修时，只要费用不超预算，我愿意接受他的方案。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F22",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "strangers",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M22",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "leverage",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "朋友认识场地方时，我会请他先探口风，再选择最容易谈成的方案。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F22",
      "contexts": [
        "private_relationship",
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H22",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "recognition",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "晚辈把交代的事情补妥后，我更看结果，不要求他低头。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H22-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "weaker_other",
        "private_relationship"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N15",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "justification",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "排班不会有人追究时，我不必另找一个统一标准支持决定。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P07",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "rules",
        "low_sanction_risk"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G03",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "tradeoff",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "合租选房时，我宁可多付一些房租，也要由自己定下最终地点。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F03",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "private_relationship"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M33",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "resistance",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "群成员反复偏离主题时，我会警告再继续就限制他的发言。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F33",
      "contexts": [
        "public",
        "rules"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H40",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "persistence",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "比我弱的一方已停止妨碍，继续压住他也不会受罚，我仍会就此停手。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H40-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "weaker_other",
        "competition",
        "low_sanction_risk"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N35",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "challenge",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "保留我的方案会失去下次参与机会时，我也不急着换个大家爱听的说法。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P17",
      "contexts": [
        "public",
        "competition",
        "sanction_risk"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G21",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "delegation",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "项目由新人负责时，我宁可进度慢一点，也想保留最终拍板权。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F21",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M19",
      "axis": "M",
      "facet": "leverage",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "有人需要我批准调班时，我会说明不补齐交接就不批准。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "M-F19",
      "contexts": [
        "authority_asymmetry",
        "rules",
        "weaker_other"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "H25",
      "axis": "H",
      "facet": "recognition",
      "direction": 1,
      "text": "裁定和补偿都已到位，我仍想让对方在下一次评选中少一次机会。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "H25-solo",
      "contexts": [
        "rules",
        "competition",
        "retaliation"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "N06",
      "axis": "N",
      "facet": "justification",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "团购有规则没写清的优惠时，我会先找一条能支持领取的说明。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "N-P02",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "G32",
      "axis": "G",
      "facet": "allocation",
      "direction": -1,
      "text": "团购名额有限时，只要我能买到需要的东西，名额由谁分配都行。",
      "primary_weight": 1,
      "family": "G-F32",
      "contexts": [
        "resource_conflict",
        "strangers",
        "rules",
        "low_stakes"
      ],
      "consistency_pair": null,
      "secondary": []
    },
    {
      "id": "M12",
      "axis": "M",
